  "text": "Pip is waiting in the present garden. Mara’s tape belongs to the earlier story and is not in this backpack.\n\nThe sections won't reach across here. Look along the river for a place where the banks are closer together.\n\nI couldn't check that feedback reliably. You can keep your ending or change it after rereading Sol's story.\n\nMara explained that her work hours changed. At the usual gathering time, she still has passengers to help.\n\nThe picture follows the event you chose. Your suggested words have not been checked against Sol’s account.\n\nThe picture is on the workbench. This is your telling; the events and chosen ending stay as they happened.\n\nThe first section is placed. Put up its four posts and tie a rope along each side before stepping onto it.\n\nSuggested picture: Baking, then the visit. Your current picture stays selected until you choose this one.\n\nAI feedback isn’t available right now. Your words are kept here. You can use a hint, revise, or continue.\n\nPip accompanied Rina to the workshop and watched her give Sol a loaf to thank him for repairing the roof.\n\nThe picture shows the event you chose. Your suggested words have not been checked against Sol’s account.\n\nLeave this stretch of water clear for the seed boat. Place the bridge sections farther along the river.\n\nAn older story shared in this garden. The stones hold the tablecloth down while the wind keeps blowing.\n\nThis flower is waiting for Mara’s story to be shared. Opening a page does not tell the story to anyone.\n\nSuggested picture: Rina bakes the bread. Your current picture stays selected until you choose this one.\n\nThe people in the garden are listening. The complete telling plays in order; you can pause at any time.",
  "textSha256": "59fc493ded916637610448bf10d27a6591addc46c28cb3853256924d9ca87b49",
